+    # Fused uint8 blend via cv2 SIMD — no float32 round-trip. Faster than
+    # the former torch CUDA blend at face-crop sizes, which paid an upload
+    # and a download per face (RTX 4060: 0.15 vs 0.68 ms at 250 px, 0.43 vs
